</style><header class="animate-rise"><div class="sur"><p class="eyebrow">Nouvelle estimation · Construction neuve</p><a class="changer" aria-label="Changer de type de projet" href="/projets/nouveau">Changer</a></div><h1 class="ttl">Comment veux-tu estimer ta maison ?</h1><p class="sub">Ta maison, du permis de construire à la remise des clés. Commence rapide, affine quand tu veux — sans rien ressaisir.</p></header><div class="grid"><section class="ch-card"><div class="row1"><span class="ico free" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M13 2 4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="tag gratis">Gratuit</span></div><h2>Estimation rapide</h2><p class="lead">5 questions, un budget tout compris immédiat. Idéal pour un premier ordre de grandeur.</p><ul><li><svg class="ck-free" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Surface, plain-pied ou étage, code postal du terrain</span></li><li><svg class="ck-free" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Études, taxes, construction et branchements compris</span></li><li><svg class="ck-free" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Sans inscription, résultat instantané</span></li></ul><div class="spacer"></div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/estimation-construction-maison">Commencer gratuitement →</a><p class="foot">Aucune carte requise</p></section><section class="ch-card pro"><div class="row1"><span class="ico pro" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 7h10M4 12h16M4 17h7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path><circle cx="17.5" cy="7" r="2.2" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="13.5" cy="17" r="2.2" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg></span><span class="tag propill" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8 1l2 4 4 .5-3 3 .8 4.3L8 11l-3.8 1.8L5 8.5 2 5.5 6 5l2-4Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>Pro</span></div><h2>Estimation détaillée</h2><p class="lead">Décris ta maison (structure, toit, chauffage, terrain) et ajuste chaque poste, phase par phase.</p><ul><li><svg class="ck-pro" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Phase par phase, du permis à la remise des clés</span></li><li><svg class="ck-pro" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Postes et quantités ajustables, démarches et jalons</span></li><li><svg class="ck-pro" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Rapport PDF et suivi de chantier</span></li></ul><div class="spacer"></div><a class="btn btn-pro" href="/tarifs?source=choix-neuf">Débloquer avec Pro →</a><p class="foot"><svg width="12" height="13" viewBox="0 0 14 16" fill="none"><path d="M3.5 7V5a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 7 0v2M2.5 7h9v6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-7a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7Z" stroke="var(--color-faint)" stroke-width="1.3"></path></svg>Fonctionnalité AVYORA Pro ·<!-- --> <a class="lien" href="/tarifs?source=choix-neuf">Voir les offres</a></p></section></div><div class="hint"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"></circle><path d="M10 9v5M10 6.2v.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg><span>Pas sûr ? Commence par l&#x27;<b>estimation rapide</b> — tu pourras passer en détaillée à tout moment, tes réponses sont conservées.</span></div></div>"
`;

