</style><header class="animate-rise"><div class="sur"><p class="eyebrow">Nouvelle estimation · Construction neuve</p><a class="changer" aria-label="Changer de type de projet" href="/projets/nouveau">Changer</a></div><h1 class="ttl">Comment veux-tu estimer ta maison ?</h1><p class="sub">Ta maison, du permis de construire à la remise des clés. Commence rapide, affine quand tu veux — sans rien ressaisir.</p></header><div class="grid"><section class="ch-card"><div class="row1"><span class="ico free" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M13 2 4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="tag gratis">Gratuit</span></div><h2>Estimation rapide</h2><p class="lead">5 questions, un budget tout compris immédiat. Idéal pour un premier ordre de grandeur.</p><ul><li><svg class="ck-free" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Surface, plain-pied ou étage, code postal du terrain</span></li><li><svg class="ck-free" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Études, taxes, construction et branchements compris</span></li><li><svg class="ck-free" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Sans inscription, résultat instantané</span></li></ul><div class="spacer"></div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/estimation-construction-maison">Commencer gratuitement →</a><p class="foot">Aucune carte requise</p></section><section class="ch-card pro"><div class="row1"><span class="ico pro" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 7h10M4 12h16M4 17h7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path><circle cx="17.5" cy="7" r="2.2" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="13.5" cy="17" r="2.2" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg></span><span class="tag propill" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8 1l2 4 4 .5-3 3 .8 4.3L8 11l-3.8 1.8L5 8.5 2 5.5 6 5l2-4Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>Pro</span></div><h2>Estimation détaillée</h2><p class="lead">Décris ta maison (structure, toit, chauffage, terrain) et ajuste chaque poste, phase par phase.</p><ul><li><svg class="ck-pro" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Phase par phase, du permis à la remise des clés</span></li><li><svg class="ck-pro" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Postes et quantités ajustables, démarches et jalons</span></li><li><svg class="ck-pro" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Rapport PDF et suivi de chantier</span></li></ul><div class="spacer"></div><a class="btn btn-pro" href="/projets/nouveau/construction?new=1">Ajuster poste par poste →</a><p class="foot"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8 1l2 4 4 .5-3 3 .8 4.3L8 11l-3.8 1.8L5 8.5 2 5.5 6 5l2-4Z" fill="var(--color-accent-500)"></path></svg>Inclus dans ton abonnement Pro</p></section></div><div class="hint"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"></circle><path d="M10 9v5M10 6.2v.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg><span>Pas sûr ? Commence par l&#x27;<b>estimation rapide</b> — tu pourras passer en détaillée à tout moment, tes réponses sont conservées.</span></div></div>"
`;

exports[`Témoins · interrupteur plans éteint > écran de choix (FR, EN ; rénovation, neuf ; gratuit, Pro) > choix fr reno gratuit 1`] = `
"<div class="av-choix"><style>
.av-choix .ttl{font-size:clamp(24px,4vw,32px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--color-ink);margin:6px 0 0}
.av-choix .sub{color:var(--color-muted);font-size:15px;margin:10px 0 0;max-width:52ch;line-height:1.6}
.av-choix .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:24px}
@media (max-width:720px){.av-choix .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.av-choix .ch-card{position:relative;background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-line);border-radius:20px;
  padding:24px 22px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(21,23,43,.04),0 12px 30px -22px rgba(21,23,43,.30);display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.av-choix .ch-card.pro{border-color:var(--color-brand-200)}
.av-choix .ch-card.pro::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:20px;padding:1px;
  background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--color-accent-400),var(--color-brand-600));
  -webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#000 0 0) content-box,linear-gradient(#000 0 0);-webkit-mask-composite:xor;mask-composite:exclude;opacity:.5;pointer-events:none}
.av-choix .row1{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}
.av-choix .ico{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:13px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none}
.av-choix .ico.free{background:var(--color-brand-50);color:var(--color-brand-600)}
.av-choix .ico.pro{background:linear-gradient(140deg,#2b2568,var(--color-brand-900));color:var(--color-accent-300)}
.av-choix .tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.03em;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap}
.av-choix .tag.gratis{background:var(--color-positive-soft);color:var(--color-positive)}
.av-choix .tag.propill{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--color-accent-600),var(--color-brand-600));color:#fff;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}
.av-choix .ch-card h2{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin:18px 0 0;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--color-ink)}
.av-choix .lead{color:var(--color-muted);font-size:14px;margin:7px 0 0;line-height:1.6}
.av-choix ul{list-style:none;margin:18px 0 0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px}
.av-choix li{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.5}
.av-choix li svg{flex:none;margin-top:2px}
.av-choix .ck-free{color:var(--color-brand-600)}
.av-choix .ck-pro{color:var(--color-accent-600)}
.av-choix .spacer{flex:1;min-height:18px}
.av-choix .btn{width:100%}
.av-choix .btn-outline{background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-brand-700);border:1px solid var(--color-line-strong)}
.av-choix .btn-outline:hover{background:var(--color-surface-2)}
.av-choix .btn-pro{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--color-accent-600),var(--color-brand-600));color:#fff;border:1px solid transparent}
.av-choix .btn-pro:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)}
.av-choix .foot{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--color-faint);margin-top:9px;text-align:center;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.av-choix .foot .lien{color:var(--color-brand-600);text-decoration:none;font-weight:500}
.av-choix .foot .lien:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.av-choix .hint{margin-top:22px;background:var(--color-surface-2);border:1px solid var(--color-line);border-radius:14px;padding:13px 16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--color-muted);display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;line-height:1.5}
.av-choix .hint svg{flex:none;color:var(--color-brand-500)}
.av-choix .hint b{color:var(--color-ink);font-weight:600}

.av-choix .sur{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px 10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.av-choix .changer{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:30px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--color-line);background:var(--color-surface);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--color-brand-700);text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s}
.av-choix .changer:hover{border-color:var(--color-brand-300);background:var(--color-brand-50)}
.av-choix .changer:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-brand-500);outline-offset:2px}
@media (pointer:coarse){.av-choix .changer{min-height:44px;padding:0 16px}}
</style><header class="animate-rise"><div class="sur"><p class="eyebrow">Nouvelle estimation · Rénovation</p><a class="changer" aria-label="Changer de type de projet" href="/projets/nouveau">Changer</a></div><h1 class="ttl">Comment veux-tu estimer ?</h1><p class="sub">Deux façons d&#x27;obtenir ton budget travaux. Commence rapide, affine quand tu veux — sans rien ressaisir.</p></header><div class="grid"><section class="ch-card"><div class="row1"><span class="ico free" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M13 2 4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="tag gratis">Gratuit</span></div><h2>Estimation rapide</h2><p class="lead">4 questions, une fourchette chiffrée immédiate. Idéal pour un premier ordre de grandeur.</p><ul><li><svg class="ck-free" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Type de bien, surface, ampleur — en 3 min</span></li><li><svg class="ck-free" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Fourchette ±15 % adaptée à ton code postal</span></li><li><svg class="ck-free" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Sans inscription, résultat instantané</span></li></ul><div class="spacer"></div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/estimation-travaux">Commencer gratuitement →</a><p class="foot">Aucune carte requise</p></section><section class="ch-card pro"><div class="row1"><span class="ico pro" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 7h10M4 12h16M4 17h7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path><circle cx="17.5" cy="7" r="2.2" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="13.5" cy="17" r="2.2" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg></span><span class="tag propill" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8 1l2 4 4 .5-3 3 .8 4.3L8 11l-3.8 1.8L5 8.5 2 5.5 6 5l2-4Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>Pro</span></div><h2>Estimation détaillée</h2><p class="lead">Ajuste chaque poste et obtiens une estimation précise, prête à comparer aux devis des artisans.</p><ul><li><svg class="ck-pro" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Poste par poste, quantités ajustables en direct</span></li><li><svg class="ck-pro" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Rapport PDF détaillé — qui fait quoi, budget par corps d&#x27;état</span></li><li><svg class="ck-pro" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Suivi de chantier et modifications illimitées</span></li></ul><div class="spacer"></div><a class="btn btn-pro" href="/tarifs?source=choix-reno">Débloquer avec Pro →</a><p class="foot"><svg width="12" height="13" viewBox="0 0 14 16" fill="none"><path d="M3.5 7V5a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 7 0v2M2.5 7h9v6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-7a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7Z" stroke="var(--color-faint)" stroke-width="1.3"></path></svg>Fonctionnalité AVYORA Pro ·<!-- --> <a class="lien" href="/tarifs?source=choix-reno">Voir les offres</a></p></section></div><div class="hint"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"></circle><path d="M10 9v5M10 6.2v.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg><span>Pas sûr ? Commence par l&#x27;<b>estimation rapide</b> — tu pourras passer en détaillée à tout moment, tes réponses sont conservées.</span></div></div>"
`;

